Name:	Beneath A Corporate Spire
Desc:$
   Towering above the harbor district and most of its buildings is a
gleaming spire of chrome and glass. This monolith is marked by the words,
"Halcyon Dynamics" at the top, in glowing blue neon, for all to see. To
the north, the revolving glass doors welcome clients and employees into
the cool, quiet, well-lit lobby.
~
